00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:57.040 line:100%
One year,

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.680 line:100%
I had the hallway renovated.

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:02.440 line:100%
I hired a relative to take the job.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:07.800 line:100%
Turns out there were quality issues.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:11.640 line:100%
One resident slipped
on the stairs at night and died.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:13.880 line:100%
I figured

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:17.080 line:100%
I should fix it before it got worse,
so I redid the hallway.

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:18.800 line:100%
But I had no money left.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:20.960 line:100%
So I secretly

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:25.240 line:100%
took materials from maintenance
and got some supplies.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:26.720 line:100%
I set up a small shack

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:28.400 line:100%
in the parking garage
and stashed the materials there.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:33.080 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.240 line:100%
why did you go to the garage?

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.720 line:100%
I just thought, once I had enough,

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.800 line:100%
I'd fix it properly.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.920 line:100%
You tell me, why'd he get so much cement?

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.440 line:100%
This cement must be about 100 kilos.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:51.920 line:100%
But then,

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.280 line:100%
that year,

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.760 line:100%
Ju… July…

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.240 line:100%
Rats. I love catching rats.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.280 line:100%
Xiaohe, slow down.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:19.200 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:23.480 line:100%
Uncle Ran, this underground maze
is so cool!

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:24.600 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.120 line:100%
stay close to me.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.800 line:100%
What if a rat suddenly jumps out?

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.240 line:20%
<i>How would I know</i>

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:57.080 line:20%
<i>there was a head and two arms</i>
<i>in that tool bag?</i>

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.720 line:100%
I did think about calling the police.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:02.760 line:100%
Did you?

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.000 line:100%
-Who is it?
-<i>Qian Dajun.</i>

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.600 line:100%
<i>You brat!</i>

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.240 line:100%
Dad.

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:34.800 line:100%
<i>Who are you calling Dad?</i>

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.280 line:100%
<i>When are you going to sell</i>
<i>the place in Yuanlongli?</i>

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.800 line:100%
Soon.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.200 line:100%
-Soon.
-<i>Not a chance.</i>

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.640 line:100%
<i>I've heard about it!</i>

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.160 line:100%
<i>They say that place eats people.</i>

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:46.280 line:100%
<i>No one dares live there.</i>
<i>Prices are dropping like crazy.</i>

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.320 line:100%
<i>Back then,</i>

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:50.040 line:100%
<i>rumors were going around</i>
<i>that the place was killing people.</i>

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.200 line:100%
<i>If I'd called the police,</i>

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:56.520 line:100%
<i>neither my place nor my relatives'</i>
<i>would've sold.</i>

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:59.000 line:100%
<i>After thinking it through,</i>

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.240 line:100%
<i>I decided to keep it quiet.</i>

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:08.160 line:100%
I figured I'd find a safer place,

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.360 line:100%
hide it first,

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.960 line:100%
then deal with it when I got the chance.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:16.680 line:100%
Careful, Xiaohe.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.920 line:100%
<i>I put it in the chicken coop.</i>

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.040 line:100%
<i>I was afraid my uncle would find it.</i>

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.360 line:100%
<i>So I thought</i>

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.200 line:100%
<i>I should move it to a safer place.</i>

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.560 line:100%
<i>But that drain inlet was too small.</i>

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:39.400 line:100%
<i>No matter what, it wouldn't fit.</i>

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.480 line:100%
<i>So I had to move it again.</i>

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.560 line:100%
When I came back,
I found the head was gone.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.400 line:100%
I couldn't find it anywhere.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.720 line:100%
So I took the bag

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:01.160 line:100%
and buried it
in the woods behind the complex.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:05.280 line:100%
I was terrified for a long time,

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:07.720 line:100%
having nightmares every day.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:11.600 line:100%
I went on like that for five years.

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.200 line:100%
I thought it was over,

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.640 line:100%
but then,

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.920 line:100%
in the summer of 2002,

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.760 line:100%
my uncle, Ge Jingsong,
pulled the head out.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:25.000 line:100%
Murder!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.400 line:100%
<i>Officer Ran went like a man possessed,</i>

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.520 line:100%
<i>tearing through the whole complex,</i>
<i>searching everywhere.</i>

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:50.440 line:100%
DANGER, ELECTRICITY

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.720 line:100%
I was guilty and scared,

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:00.520 line:100%
so I dug the bag back up

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.000 line:100%
and moved it.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.920 line:100%
SO I MOVED THE BAG

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.160 line:100%
But later, I almost got caught
by Officer Ran.

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:16.040 line:100%
Open it.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:18.760 line:100%
At that time,

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:21.560 line:100%
the underground garage
was under construction.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.280 line:100%
I took advantage of the moment

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.760 line:100%
and stuffed the arm bones into the cement

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.480 line:100%
and made a cement block.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.640 line:100%
I thought this time, no one would find it.

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:34.000 line:100%
But I didn't expect,

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.280 line:100%
after more than ten years,

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:39.960 line:100%
I'd be the one to dig it up myself.

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:49.560 line:100%
These bones have been
weighing on me ever since.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.720 line:100%
I hate Yuanlongli!

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:55.000 line:100%
I hate it so much!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:57.400 line:100%
I wish it were torn down sooner!
Just tear it down!

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:01.040 line:100%
And these bones
and all the monsters all gone!

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.120 line:100%
Gone for good!

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.360 line:100%
Then no one would care
about this case anymore!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:07.920 line:100%
Never again.

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:27.360 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.200 line:100%
What Qian Dajun said is mostly reliable.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:32.760 line:100%
What he mentioned, the 1997 garage
and the rooftop incident,

00:08:32.839 --> 00:08:34.880 line:100%
I did go through
those things with Uncle Ran.

00:08:34.959 --> 00:08:36.080 line:100%
Preliminarily, it looks like Qian Dajun

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.680 line:100%
has nothing to do with Xu Meng
and her father's deaths.

00:08:40.359 --> 00:08:41.479 line:100%
Qian Dajun's arrest

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:44.480 line:100%
means Yuanlongli
probably won't be demolished early.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.840 line:100%
<i>We still have time to keep investigating.</i>

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:51.120 line:100%
Oh, and we should
circle back to Qian Dajun,

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:54.120 line:100%
question him again about
everything related to the June 30th case.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.240 line:100%
<i>Maybe it'll lead to something bigger.</i>

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.160 line:100%
Okay.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:11.680 line:100%
Uncle He.

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:13.600 line:100%
Uncle He. Good afternoon.

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:17.000 line:100%
I was just appointed by the company

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:21.920 line:100%
as the Yuanlongli project's
head of redevelopment.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:23.760 line:100%
JIN MANLANG, RELOCATION MANAGER

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:30.800 line:100%
The company also promised
that if the demolition wraps up quickly,

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.040 line:100%
I'll be promoted to vice president.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.840 line:100%
-So…
-So, what's that got to do with me?

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:38.920 line:100%
Uncle He,

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:42.960 line:100%
I'm not like Qian Dajun, I'm different.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:46.000 line:100%
I believe in sincerity

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:48.560 line:100%
and peace above all.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:56.840 line:100%
Uncle He, this place,
I'm not renting this place anymore.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:59.320 line:100%
The rent will be returned double.

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:01.160 line:100%
Please move out.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.120 line:100%
Double the rent.

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:08.760 line:100%
Wait.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:22.160 line:100%
It's in black and white.
It's legal and valid.

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:25.480 line:100%
I paid, so I have the right to stay
for three full months.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.880 line:100%
If you don't like it,

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.880 line:100%
you can go to court and sue me.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.920 line:100%
How long it takes, I don't care.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.680 line:100%
Uncle He, let's talk this over.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.800 line:100%
I'll pay you triple rent.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.800 line:100%
Wang Laosan, come here.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.840 line:100%
Get out of here.

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:48.800 line:100%
I've worked myself
to the bone all these years

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:52.000 line:100%
and finally got my chance
to turn things around.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.800 line:100%
Now, anyone who gets in my way,

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.480 line:100%
don't blame me, Jin Manlang,
for turning ruthless!

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:01.720 line:100%
Who was it that said "peace above all"?

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.040 line:100%
-Uncle He.
-See yourself out.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.160 line:100%
Well…

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:13.720 line:100%
Wolf, don't get mad.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.440 line:100%
Peace above all.

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.440 line:100%
Darn it!

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.200 line:100%
Wolf. Wolf!

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:25.960 line:100%
What's that?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.080 line:100%
-That bag looks heavy.
-Did you see that?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.880 line:100%
-That bag must be money.
-<i>Powering on.</i>

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.720 line:100%
<i>Good news! Good news!</i>

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:38.120 line:100%
<i>The company has benefits for everyone!</i>

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:40.040 line:100%
<i>100k yuan per household,</i>

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:41.600 line:100%
<i>extra compensation.</i>

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.000 line:100%
<i>Just sign the contract.</i>

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.320 line:100%
-<i>Take the money now!</i>
-Let's go!

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.600 line:100%
-Go take a look. Check it out.
-<i>Take the money now!</i>

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.240 line:100%
-<i>Limited spots.</i>
-Me first.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.720 line:100%
-<i>First come, first served!</i>
-Me first!

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.000 line:100%
Is it real?

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.600 line:100%
-They're really paying!
-Is it real?

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.280 line:100%
Come on! Line up!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.760 line:100%
Line up, line up!

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:58.200 line:100%
<i>Benefits for everyone!</i>

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:03.840 line:100%
Don't rush!

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:07.000 line:100%
One at a time! Don't rush!

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.400 line:100%
One at a time!

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:28.280 line:100%
Meng, you've got to hold on,

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:30.080 line:100%
stay and keep me company.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.880 line:100%
Don't let a little money blind you.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:50.440 line:100%
OFFICER HE, MENG'S BEEN DETAINED!

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.880 line:100%
Let Mr. Meng enjoy this

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.840 line:100%
Western symphony!

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:20.920 line:100%
So we're talking it out now?

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:22.840 line:100%
No more fighting?

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.440 line:100%
Why are you all staring at me?

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.720 line:100%
Keep the music going.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.880 line:100%
Play something upbeat.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.880 line:100%
Can't you see the door's open?

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:45.920 line:100%
Hurry up.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:49.080 line:100%
Get Mr. Meng out here.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.640 line:100%
STAGED SCENE. DO NOT IMITATE

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.280 line:100%
I'll send you all to hell!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.080 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.400 line:100%
You old fool, want to die?

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:09.720 line:100%
You brat!

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.320 line:100%
I'll send you all to hell!

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.760 line:100%
That's illegal! You hear me?

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:14.920 line:100%
Call the police!

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.280 line:100%
Call the police now!

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:18.840 line:100%
I'll send you all to hell!

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:21.560 line:100%
<i>Come on!</i>

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.840 line:100%
Wolfie, you just won't go away.

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:50.760 line:100%
Uncle He.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.680 line:100%
Qiao, what are you doing here?

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.320 line:100%
Come in, come in.

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:59.000 line:100%
Well, what do you want to drink?
I'll get it.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.320 line:100%
Uncle He, don't bother.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.240 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.000 line:100%
I…

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.400 line:100%
I didn't get our boss's approval,

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:09.800 line:100%
but I had finance sign off
on a 50k moving fee for you.

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:14.640 line:100%
Qiao, what's going on?

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:19.400 line:100%
Didn't we agree
to fulfill Ran's wish together?

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:20.760 line:100%
I know.

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:27.400 line:100%
I appreciate it, but I'm not moving.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.920 line:100%
No matter the offer,
no matter the money, I won't move.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:32.080 line:100%
That's final! You should go.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.240 line:100%
Uncle He. Uncle He.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.960 line:100%
Our boss has reported you to the station.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.560 line:100%
You should be ready.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.160 line:20%
FORENSIC REPORT

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:56.640 line:100%
Xia, Xia…

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:59.000 line:100%
Xiaohe, go to Captain Zhao's office.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.040 line:100%
What's going on?

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.800 line:100%
Captain Zhao, we're a private company.
It's not easy.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.760 line:100%
This project can't be delayed anymore.

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:09.560 line:100%
If He Yuanhang keeps this up,

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.960 line:100%
it won't just hurt
our company's legal rights,

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:15.560 line:100%
it'll also undermine
what the residents deserve.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:19.880 line:100%
Your criminal department
needs to stand up for people like us!

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:20.920 line:100%
I understand.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:23.640 line:100%
We will figure this out quickly

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.000 line:100%
and give you answers. Alright?

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.480 line:100%
Thank you, Captain Zhao.

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.360 line:100%
Please hurry. This can't wait.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.760 line:100%
Come on. I'll walk you out.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.200 line:100%
Okay, okay.

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:33.400 line:100%
-I'll head out then.
-Okay.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:36.000 line:100%
Captain Zhao, stand up for us!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:38.280 line:100%
-Alright.
-Okay. Take care.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.520 line:100%
What's with He Yuanhang?

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.760 line:100%
Has he lost it again?

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:55.400 line:100%
Captain Zhao, Captain Qu,
since you're both here,

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:57.040 line:100%
I'd like to request

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.440 line:100%
reopening the investigation
into the June 30th case.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.160 line:100%
June 30th?

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:04.560 line:100%
That's ancient history.

00:17:04.639 --> 00:17:07.360 line:100%
He Xiaohe, you're just as crazy
as your dad.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:08.760 line:100%
Isn't this mess enough?

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:11.520 line:100%
Captain Zhao,

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.360 line:100%
before Captain Ran passed,
he secretly reopened the June 30th case.

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.919 line:100%
These days, my dad and I
have been retracing his investigation.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:24.520 line:100%
Now we have solid leads
proving Wu Shanlong was framed.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.800 line:100%
The real killer is someone else.

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:30.440 line:100%
Any suspects?

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.560 line:100%
We are still checking.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.280 line:100%
Not yet.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.000 line:100%
Captain Zhao,

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.560 line:100%
this whole thing started because my dad

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.680 line:100%
found an unsent message
on Uncle Ran's old phone.

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.760 line:100%
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE
SAVED: 2003-01-31 13:09:37 TO: SIR

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.400 line:100%
RAN: SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE
WAS WRONG, ALL WRONG

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:04.160 line:100%
This message was written
on the day he died.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:10.880 line:100%
Uncle Ran died with that regret.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.520 line:100%
With the leads and evidence we have,
is it enough to reopen the case?

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:25.520 line:100%
I trust my dad.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.000 line:100%
Just give him more time,

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.200 line:100%
he'll definitely find
key clues in Yuanlongli.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:30.760 line:100%
We have to move fast.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.600 line:100%
Otherwise, we won't have the authority
to stop the legal demolition.

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.560 line:100%
Got it.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:38.200 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:48.960 line:100%
<i>Tenant of 609, listen up!</i>

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:53.360 line:100%
<i>All residents of Yuanlongli</i>
<i>have moved out.</i>

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:56.600 line:100%
<i>Now, you're the only one left.</i>

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.840 line:100%
<i>Your landlord has already sold the place.</i>

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:02.520 line:100%
<i>Please leave immediately.</i>

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.160 line:100%
<i>Otherwise,</i>

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:07.280 line:100%
<i>the demolition team</i>
<i>will remove you by force.</i>

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.440 line:100%
<i>Remove you by force.</i>

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:27.120 line:100%
HONGYUN HUIHUANG (DAHUIHUANG)

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:29.280 line:100%
JIN MANSHAN

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:32.200 line:100%
<i>Tenant of 609, listen up!</i>

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:36.360 line:100%
<i>All residents of Yuanlongli</i>
<i>have moved out.</i>

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:39.640 line:100%
<i>Now, you're the only one left.</i>

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:43.160 line:100%
<i>Your landlord has already sold the place.</i>

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.120 line:100%
<i>Please leave immediately.</i>

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.160 line:100%
<i>Otherwise,</i>

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:50.720 line:100%
<i>the demolition team</i>
<i>will remove you by force.</i>

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:52.360 line:100%
<i>Remove you by force.</i>

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:54.800 line:100%
<i>Remove you by force.</i>

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:31.280 line:100%
<i>Sir.</i>

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:47.040 line:100%
Sir,

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:50.320 line:100%
are you trying to use
the golden birdcage effect?

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:58.600 line:100%
All the monsters
in Yuanlongli are still here.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.960 line:100%
As long as I keep digging,
the devil will slip up.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:07.280 line:100%
Right now, I'll be the golden cage

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:09.400 line:100%
and lure the devil out.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:13.440 line:100%
Then, I'll capture everything.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:34.400 line:100%
<i>Powering on.</i>

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:41.160 line:100%
He, I'm giving you ten more minutes.

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.160 line:100%
After that,

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.760 line:100%
don't blame me for doing my job.

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.480 line:20%
DAHUIHUANG

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:12.000 line:100%
DAHUIHUANG NIGHTCLUB

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:13.880 line:100%
How did Xu Zhihong die?

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:15.280 line:100%
Where is Xu Meng?

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:16.680 line:100%
Is she dead or alive?

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:18.640 line:100%
DAHUIHUANG, JIN MANSHAN

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:19.800 line:100%
Recognize this?

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:22.320 line:100%
I really have no idea.

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:23.200 line:100%
JIN MANSHAN

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:24.640 line:100%
<i>Pay up!</i>

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:26.200 line:100%
Since Wu became the factory director…

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:28.320 line:100%
It shut down last month.

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:29.440 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY
DRAGON TIGER

00:22:29.520 --> 00:22:31.840 line:100%
When was the last time the father
and daughter were seen leaving home?

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:35.040 line:100%
People said it was the day
before Hong Kong, China's handover.

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:36.080 line:100%
Someone saw them leave,

00:22:36.760 --> 00:22:38.480 line:100%
-and they never came back.
-Never came back.

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:40.360 line:20%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:43.200 line:20%
Back in '97, someone came
to the video rental shop

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:44.920 line:100%
to hire Wolfie to kill someone.

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:49.480 line:100%
Pattia Club.

00:22:49.560 --> 00:22:50.560 line:100%
PATTIA CLUB

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:54.280 line:100%
<i>In the end, it was all to run away</i>
<i>from debt collectors.</i>

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:56.520 line:100%
PATTIA CLUB
ZHAO HONGMEI

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.320 line:100%
Did she meet any clients
on her last day here?

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:02.560 line:100%
I don't know.

00:23:02.640 --> 00:23:03.680 line:20%
ZHAO HONGMEI, ZHANG ERSONG, SONGBENTANG

00:23:03.760 --> 00:23:05.240 line:20%
A conflict is one thing,

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:07.920 line:20%
but it wouldn't escalate
to the level of murder.

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:09.200 line:20%
ZHANG ERSONG, SONGBENTANG

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.840 line:100%
Su Yuzhi.

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:13.560 line:100%
Are you saying Mr. Sun has something to do
with Mengmeng's disappearance?

00:23:13.640 --> 00:23:14.840 line:20%
SU YUZHI

00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:16.080 line:100%
Song Qingsong.

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:17.440 line:100%
About that young woman
at the foot massage shop,

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:19.920 line:100%
it's true I paid Wu Shanlong
to get rid of her.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:20.800 line:100%
Jin Manlang.

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:22.120 line:100%
It's all chicken blood.

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:24.720 line:100%
If it's human blood,
just shoot me on the spot.

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:26.920 line:20%
JIN MANLANG, WAN QIMING

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.920 line:100%
In the summer of 1996,

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:32.120 line:100%
someone paid me 500 yuan
to spy on the unit opposite.

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:33.720 line:100%
I have an alibi.

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:35.560 line:100%
WAN QIMING, QIAN DAJUN

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:36.240 line:20%
GOOD NEIGHBOR TAILOR SHOP, ALTERATIONS

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:48.840 line:20%
QIAN DAJUN, YUANLONGLI ROOFTOP

00:23:48.920 --> 00:23:49.920 line:100%
The rooftop.

00:23:57.200 --> 00:23:59.600 line:100%
That cut was made after death,
likely during dismemberment.

00:24:00.440 --> 00:24:01.600 line:100%
High probability of homicide.

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:05.920 line:100%
Qihuang Clinic.

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:09.280 line:100%
QIHUANG CLINIC

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:12.720 line:100%
Sun Zhengyong.

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:14.480 line:100%
She took her dad and left.

00:24:14.560 --> 00:24:16.760 line:100%
They bought train tickets for July 1st.

00:24:16.840 --> 00:24:18.560 line:20%
QIHUANG CLINIC
YUANLONGLI UNDERGROUND GARAGE

00:24:25.800 --> 00:24:27.520 line:20%
YUANLONGLI UNDERGROUND GARAGE

00:24:27.600 --> 00:24:29.360 line:20%
Wu Shanlong said

00:24:29.440 --> 00:24:32.280 line:20%
he went and did the deed himself.

00:24:32.360 --> 00:24:33.600 line:20%
HU ANPING

00:24:34.280 --> 00:24:35.400 line:100%
Dajianchang.

00:24:35.480 --> 00:24:36.360 line:100%
Double Fish.

00:24:39.480 --> 00:24:41.840 line:100%
This dress is probably
worth more than this unit.

00:24:42.360 --> 00:24:43.880 line:20%
DAJIANCHANG, XU MENG'S HOME

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:52.520 line:100%
MOUNT WU ACCIDENT

00:24:55.160 --> 00:24:57.440 line:100%
Is the accident investigation report
still available?

00:24:58.200 --> 00:24:59.360 line:100%
Yes. It's all still here.

00:24:59.440 --> 00:25:01.080 line:100%
Sir, your package.

00:25:02.440 --> 00:25:04.440 line:100%
This is the Mount Wu accident file.

00:25:04.960 --> 00:25:06.240 line:100%
We don't need it now.

00:25:08.560 --> 00:25:10.120 line:100%
MOUNT WU ACCIDENT

00:25:13.880 --> 00:25:15.840 line:20%
MOUNT WU ACCIDENT

00:25:17.760 --> 00:25:19.280 line:100%
KIDDO

00:25:22.360 --> 00:25:25.480 line:100%
Kiddo, when we first moved here,

00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:29.600 line:100%
did you see a package
from Mount Wu, Kunhai?

00:25:30.280 --> 00:25:31.160 line:100%
I did.

00:25:31.240 --> 00:25:33.240 line:100%
At the time, it wasn't even opened,

00:25:33.840 --> 00:25:35.440 line:100%
I thought it was useless,
so I didn't take it.

00:25:35.520 --> 00:25:37.720 line:100%
Dad, is there a clue inside?

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:41.840 line:100%
I just reviewed all info and leads
on the June 30th case,

00:25:41.920 --> 00:25:45.360 line:20%
and only the Mount Wu files
haven't been checked.

00:25:45.440 --> 00:25:48.240 line:20%
MOUNT WU ACCIDENT

00:26:09.640 --> 00:26:11.320 line:100%
Last minute!

00:26:12.360 --> 00:26:13.600 line:100%
Fifty-nine!

00:26:14.440 --> 00:26:15.480 line:100%
Fifty-eight!

00:26:16.360 --> 00:26:18.400 line:100%
-Fifty--
-Bro.

00:26:37.040 --> 00:26:38.600 line:100%
This is from me personally.

00:26:39.640 --> 00:26:43.640 line:100%
Th-This, Wolf, you really look out for us.

00:26:46.240 --> 00:26:47.920 line:100%
-Bro, H-He…
-He…

00:26:48.000 --> 00:26:49.520 line:100%
-He!
-It's him!

00:26:54.400 --> 00:26:55.320 line:100%
He.

00:26:57.360 --> 00:26:59.760 line:100%
Finally, changed your mind?

00:27:03.920 --> 00:27:07.840 line:100%
I'm telling you, stay away from my room!

00:27:08.360 --> 00:27:10.400 line:100%
Or I can still lock you up!

00:27:11.200 --> 00:27:12.440 line:100%
Got it, Officer He.

00:27:24.080 --> 00:27:25.160 line:100%
Darn it!

00:27:26.600 --> 00:27:28.800 line:100%
That old man's retired.
Why would I fear him?

00:27:28.880 --> 00:27:29.760 line:100%
Biao,

00:27:30.280 --> 00:27:33.360 line:100%
now you go seal off Room 609.

00:27:33.440 --> 00:27:35.000 line:100%
If you can't, I'll deal with you!

00:27:35.080 --> 00:27:37.400 line:100%
-Yes, sir.
-Mang, notify security,

00:27:37.480 --> 00:27:38.440 line:100%
lock down New York Block,

00:27:38.520 --> 00:27:40.760 line:100%
cordon it off!

00:27:40.840 --> 00:27:42.160 line:100%
Not even a fly gets in!

00:27:42.240 --> 00:27:43.280 line:100%
Got it, bro!

00:27:48.600 --> 00:27:49.440 line:100%
Captain Liu,

00:27:49.520 --> 00:27:51.400 line:100%
New York Block is cleared.

00:27:52.040 --> 00:27:54.600 line:100%
Now, take your team in and inspect.

00:27:54.680 --> 00:27:56.080 line:100%
Prepare the blast points!

00:28:38.920 --> 00:28:40.400 line:20%
AUGUST 24TH MOUNT WU ACCIDENT REPORT

00:28:48.600 --> 00:28:51.680 line:100%
LIST OF VICTIMS

00:28:54.120 --> 00:28:57.960 line:100%
XU ZHIHONG, XU MENG

00:29:32.920 --> 00:29:33.960 line:100%
Ran,

00:29:36.560 --> 00:29:38.320 line:100%
turns out I'm not the cage.

00:29:40.680 --> 00:29:41.960 line:100%
The cursed building is.

00:29:50.520 --> 00:29:51.360 line:100%
Officer.

00:29:52.440 --> 00:29:54.520 line:100%
Officer, where are you taking me?

00:29:54.600 --> 00:29:56.960 line:100%
Move. Move.

00:29:57.040 --> 00:29:57.920 line:100%
Qian Dajun.

00:30:02.840 --> 00:30:03.760 line:100%
Officer He.

00:30:03.840 --> 00:30:04.600 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:30:04.680 --> 00:30:07.280 line:100%
Have you heard
of someone in Yuanlongli named

00:30:07.360 --> 00:30:09.920 line:100%
Yao Xincheng?

00:30:11.120 --> 00:30:12.960 line:100%
Yao Xincheng.

00:30:13.840 --> 00:30:15.200 line:100%
I know who that is.

00:30:16.960 --> 00:30:19.000 line:20%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:30:31.280 --> 00:30:32.600 line:100%
-Officer He! Officer He!
-You're not getting up there.

00:30:33.360 --> 00:30:34.480 line:100%
-Office He!
-Move!

00:30:35.080 --> 00:30:35.920 line:100%
It's sealed.

00:30:36.000 --> 00:30:37.200 line:100%
If you don't, I'll bite!

00:30:38.200 --> 00:30:39.040 line:100%
Officer He!

00:30:39.120 --> 00:30:43.720 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:30:43.800 --> 00:30:45.800 line:100%
You… What are you doing?

00:30:45.880 --> 00:30:47.320 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:30:47.400 --> 00:30:48.400 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:30:48.480 --> 00:30:49.880 line:100%
You're paying holdouts more?

00:30:49.960 --> 00:30:50.960 line:100%
What's that supposed to mean?

00:30:51.040 --> 00:30:54.320 line:100%
Just because we're not holdouts
doesn't mean we're pushovers!

00:30:54.400 --> 00:30:57.520 line:100%
Pay more, or I'll move back in!

00:30:58.520 --> 00:31:00.160 line:100%
You… What are you doing?

00:31:00.240 --> 00:31:01.440 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:31:01.520 --> 00:31:02.560 line:100%
DON'T LET HONEST PEOPLE LOSE OUT
EQUAL TREATMENT!

00:31:02.640 --> 00:31:06.920 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:31:07.000 --> 00:31:10.000 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:31:17.600 --> 00:31:18.600 line:100%
You brat.

00:31:21.160 --> 00:31:22.280 line:20%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:31:22.360 --> 00:31:24.320 line:100%
Everyone, calm down!

00:31:30.320 --> 00:31:32.200 line:100%
Don't get worked up!

00:31:32.280 --> 00:31:36.320 line:100%
I'll ask the company soon
to raise the compensation.

00:31:40.440 --> 00:31:42.440 line:100%
We don't want "soon", we want it now.

00:31:42.520 --> 00:31:43.600 line:100%
That's right!

00:31:49.080 --> 00:31:52.000 line:100%
Everyone, stay calm!

00:31:52.080 --> 00:31:53.280 line:100%
Stay calm!

00:31:55.600 --> 00:31:57.400 line:20%
Why are residents
rioting at the cursed building,

00:31:57.480 --> 00:31:58.240 line:20%
demanding huge compensation?

00:31:58.320 --> 00:31:59.280 line:20%
With over 20 years of history,

00:31:59.360 --> 00:32:02.440 line:20%
Yuanlongli, known as the cursed building,
is about to be demolished.

00:32:02.520 --> 00:32:05.920 line:100%
Let's witness together
the final chapter of this legendary place.

00:32:06.000 --> 00:32:07.880 line:100%
This cursed building will claim 18 lives.

00:32:07.960 --> 00:32:08.920 line:100%
Two more to go.

00:32:09.000 --> 00:32:11.440 line:100%
In there, isn't one still hiding?

00:32:11.520 --> 00:32:14.080 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:32:14.160 --> 00:32:15.040 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:32:15.120 --> 00:32:16.320 line:100%
Where's He?

00:32:16.400 --> 00:32:23.320 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:32:29.720 --> 00:32:30.600 line:20%
2002 YUANLONGLI OWNER/TENANT REGISTRY

00:32:39.480 --> 00:32:40.960 line:100%
-Hello?
-<i>Hello? Who is this?</i>

00:32:41.040 --> 00:32:42.000 line:100%
Hello.

00:32:42.520 --> 00:32:45.440 line:100%
I'm He Yuanhang,
a retired detective from Nanshan Branch.

00:32:45.520 --> 00:32:47.400 line:100%
I'd like to ask you something.

00:32:47.920 --> 00:32:48.840 line:100%
<i>Hello, Officer He.</i>

00:32:48.920 --> 00:32:50.320 line:100%
In 2002,

00:32:50.400 --> 00:32:52.840 line:100%
did you buy a place in Yuanlongli?

00:32:52.920 --> 00:32:54.040 line:100%
<i>Yes.</i>

00:32:54.120 --> 00:32:56.560 line:100%
<i>But in 2003, I sold the place.</i>

00:32:57.480 --> 00:32:58.320 line:100%
That's not right.

00:32:58.400 --> 00:33:00.760 line:100%
That place is still under your name.

00:33:00.840 --> 00:33:01.680 line:100%
<i>Here's the thing.</i>

00:33:01.760 --> 00:33:04.480 line:100%
<i>The buyer signed the agreement, paid me,</i>

00:33:04.560 --> 00:33:06.520 line:100%
<i>and never came back</i>
<i>to transfer the ownership.</i>

00:33:06.600 --> 00:33:08.640 line:100%
<i>So the owner's name is still mine.</i>

00:33:09.240 --> 00:33:10.080 line:100%
<i>Right.</i>

00:33:10.160 --> 00:33:12.840 line:100%
<i>Over ten years ago,</i>
<i>a cop also came to me about this.</i>

00:33:13.960 --> 00:33:16.240 line:100%
Was it the night
before New Year's Eve in 2003?

00:33:16.320 --> 00:33:18.280 line:100%
<i>Yes, yes. The next day was New Year's Eve.</i>

00:33:18.960 --> 00:33:21.160 line:100%
What was the buyer's name?

00:33:21.240 --> 00:33:22.080 line:100%
<i>Yao Xincheng.</i>

00:33:22.680 --> 00:33:24.800 line:100%
<i>He had someone else handle it for him.</i>

00:33:25.600 --> 00:33:29.000 line:100%
So this proxy and the one who sold you
the place in 2002

00:33:29.080 --> 00:33:30.200 line:100%
were the same person?

00:33:30.280 --> 00:33:31.720 line:100%
<i>How did you know?</i>

00:33:32.800 --> 00:33:33.600 line:100%
<i>Pay more! Pay more!</i>

00:33:33.680 --> 00:33:34.880 line:20%
NO SERVICE

00:33:35.600 --> 00:33:39.280 line:100%
He, I'm giving you my final warning!

00:33:40.160 --> 00:33:42.000 line:100%
Get out right now!

00:33:42.080 --> 00:33:44.800 line:100%
Otherwise, you face the consequences!

00:33:46.960 --> 00:33:49.880 line:100%
Biao, go turn the power all the way up.

00:33:49.960 --> 00:33:53.840 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:33:55.840 --> 00:33:58.000 line:100%
-What's going on?
-It's the sixth floor.

00:33:58.080 --> 00:33:58.960 line:100%
The one on the sixth floor.

00:33:59.880 --> 00:34:02.000 line:20%
STAGED SCENE. DO NOT IMITATE

00:34:19.240 --> 00:34:20.240 line:100%
<i>Powering on.</i>

00:34:41.400 --> 00:34:43.160 line:100%
This tune's kind of tacky.

00:34:43.240 --> 00:34:45.880 line:100%
-Tacky is what gives it power.
-Yea, power.

00:34:46.479 --> 00:34:50.880 line:100%
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

00:34:50.959 --> 00:34:53.880 line:20%
